WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Just Speak to It for iPhone, captured in the iOS Simulator. Sample data: fictional History and fixed test text.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.533
Tap the button to start

00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:08.067
Words appear as you speak. The Simulator uses fixed test text, not a microphone

00:00:08.067 --> 00:00:11.067
Stop, then copy the text into any app

00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:14.600
Use Apple’s on-device speech, or a cloud model

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:18.133
Set what the Action Button and Shortcuts do with the words

00:00:18.133 --> 00:00:20.133
Just Speak to It for iPhone. Details at justspeaktoit.com
